{'symbol': 'CPT', 'date': '2021-03-03 16:15:00', 'title': "CAMDEN PROPERTY TRUST ANNOUNCES PARTICIPATION IN CITI'S 2021 VIRTUAL GLOBAL PROPERTY CEO CONFERENCE", 'text': "HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CAMDEN PROPERTY TRUST (NYSE:CPT) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT THE COMPANY WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE CITI 2021 VIRTUAL GLOBAL PROPERTY CEO CONFERENCE. CAMDEN'S ROUNDTABLE DISCUSSION HAS BEEN SCHEDULED FOR MONDAY, MARCH 8, 2021 AT 9:30 AM CENTRAL TIME. THE EVENT WILL BE WEBCAST LIVE IN A LISTEN-ONLY MODE AT CAMDENLIVING.COM IN THE INVESTORS SECTION, AND AN AUDIO ARCHIVE WILL BE AVAILABLE ON THE COMPANY'S WEBSITE SHORTLY AFTER THE EVENT CONCLUDES. CAMDEN PROPERTY TRUST, AN S&P"}